        "body": "<div>Dear Milad,</div><div>I’m reaching out with a quick question. I’ve recently adjusted the questionnaires and paused the SCED B survey by removing the time triggering logic, so it no longer rolls out but is still preserved. I’ve also uploaded the \"devices\" for each participant. For most participants, the SCED B survey is no longer included in the activities session, except for one participant.</div><div>Do you have an explanation for this? Could it be that the participant needs to take some action to synchronize their app?</div><div>Looking forward to your insights</div><div>Best Regards, Ilse Krah</div><div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Met vriendelijke groet,</div>\n<div>\n<b> </b>\n</div>\n<div>Ilse Krah</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\">Psychotherapeut (</span>BIG-nummer: 69926981816)</div>\n<span style=\" background-color: white;\">GZ-Psycholoog (BIG-nummer: 49926981825)</span>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Bergen op Zoom</div>\n<div>Werkdagen: maandag, dinsdag, donderdag, vrijdagochtend</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<img style=\"max-width:100%;max-width: 100%;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25282/77400/130875?view=inline\">\n</div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\"><i><br>\n</i></span>\n</div>\n</div>",
