        "body": "<div>Hi Milad,</div><div>Please disregard my previous email. The issue has already been resolved.</div><div>Thanks!</div><div>Best regards,</div><div> </div><div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Met vriendelijke groet,</div>\n<div>\n<b> </b>\n</div>\n<div>Ilse Krah</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\">Psychotherapeut (</span>BIG-nummer: 69926981816)</div>\n<span style=\" background-color: white;\">GZ-Psycholoog (BIG-nummer: 49926981825)</span>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Bergen op Zoom</div>\n<div>Werkdagen: maandag, dinsdag, donderdag, vrijdagochtend</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<img style=\"max-width:100%;max-width: 100%;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25282/77401/130879?view=inline\">\n</div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\"><i><br>\n</i></span>\n</div>\n</div><hr>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<b>Van:</b> Ilse Krah<br>\n<b>Verzonden:</b> vrijdag 27 september 2024 16:49<br>\n<b>Aan:</b> Milad Moosavi &lt;support@avicennaresearch.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Onderwerp:</b> SCED B List Issue for One Participant <div> </div>\n</div><div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>Dear Milad,</div>\n<div>I’m reaching out with a quick question. I’ve recently adjusted the questionnaires and paused the SCED B survey by removing the time triggering logic, so it no longer rolls out but is still preserved. I’ve also uploaded the \"devices\" for each participant. For most participants, the SCED B survey is no longer included in the activities session, except for one participant.</div>\n<div>Do you have an explanation for this? Could it be that the participant needs to take some action to synchronize their app?</div>\n<div>Looking forward to your insights</div>\n<div>Best Regards, Ilse Krah</div>\n<div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Met vriendelijke groet,</div>\n<div>\n<b> </b>\n</div>\n<div>Ilse Krah</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color:white;\">Psychotherapeut (</span>BIG-nummer: 69926981816)</div>\n<span style=\" background-color:white;\">GZ-Psycholoog (BIG-nummer: 49926981825)</span>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Bergen op Zoom</div>\n<div>Werkdagen: maandag, dinsdag, donderdag, vrijdagochtend</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<img style=\"max-width:100%;max-width:100%;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25282/77401/130878?view=inline\">\n</div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color:white;\"><i><br>\n</i></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
