        "body": "Greetings dear Ilse<div>This is Amin from the Avicenna team,</div><div>I'm filling in Milad's position as he's off today. I'm glad that your issue is resolved. Nevertheless, please feel free to reach out anytime you run into any issues and be sure that we'll be more than happy to help you.<br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"2\">\n<div>\n<br>Best regards,<br><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Amin<br></span><br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25282/b62f05342f00de29\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25282/b62f05342f00de29\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25282/b62f05342f00de29</a><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: support@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Saturday, September 28, 2024 at 3:13:57 PM, Ilse Krah wrote:<br><br><div>Hi Milad,</div>\n<div>Please disregard my previous email. The issue has already been resolved.</div>\n<div>Thanks!</div>\n<div>Best regards,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Met vriendelijke groet,</div>\n<div>\n<b> </b>\n</div>\n<div>Ilse Krah</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\">Psychotherapeut (</span>BIG-nummer: 69926981816)</div>\n<span style=\" background-color: white;\">GZ-Psycholoog (BIG-nummer: 49926981825)</span>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Bergen op Zoom</div>\n<div>Werkdagen: maandag, dinsdag, donderdag, vrijdagochtend</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<img style=\"m